---
Pin messages so a sweep leaves them where they are. Pins are local to this machine

Usage: mxr pin [OPTIONS] <MESSAGE_ID>...

Arguments:
  <MESSAGE_ID>...

Options:
      --format <FORMAT>  [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help             Print help
